msgstr ""
"Podprocesy jsou k dispozici ve Windows, pokud je použita "
":class:`ProactorEventLoop`. Podrobnosti viz :ref:`Subprocess Support on "
"Windows <asyncio-windows-subprocess>`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:124
