":meth:`loop.connect_read_pipe`, :meth:`loop.connect_write_pipe`, stejně jako"
" :ref:`Subprocess Transports <asyncio-subprocess-transports>` a "
":ref:`Subprocess Protocols <asyncio-subprocess-protocols>`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:132
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstanty"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:137
msgid "Can be passed to the *stdin*, *stdout* or *stderr* parameters."
msgstr "Lze předat parametrům *stdin*, *stdout* nebo *stderr*."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:139
msgid ""
"If *PIPE* is passed to *stdin* argument, the :attr:`Process.stdin "
"<asyncio.subprocess.Process.stdin>` attribute will point to a "
":class:`~asyncio.StreamWriter` instance."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je *PIPE* předáno argumentu *stdin*, bude atribut :attr:`Process.stdin"
" <asyncio.subprocess.Process.stdin>` ukazovat na instanci "
":class:`~asyncio.StreamWriter`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:143
msgid ""
"If *PIPE* is passed to *stdout* or *stderr* arguments, the "
":attr:`Process.stdout <asyncio.subprocess.Process.stdout>` and "
":attr:`Process.stderr <asyncio.subprocess.Process.stderr>` attributes will "
"point to :class:`~asyncio.StreamReader` instances."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je *PIPE* předáno argumentům *stdout* nebo *stderr*, budou atributy "
":attr:`Process.stdout <asyncio.subprocess.Process.stdout>` a "
":attr:`Process.stderr <asyncio.subprocess.Process.stderr>` ukazovat na "
"instance :class:`~asyncio.StreamReader`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:151
msgid ""
"Special value that can be used as the *stderr* argument and indicates that "
"standard error should be redirected into standard output."
msgstr ""
"Speciální hodnota, kterou lze použít jako argument *stderr* a indikuje, že "
"standardní chyba by měla být přesměrována na standardní výstup."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:157
msgid ""
"Special value that can be used as the *stdin*, *stdout* or *stderr* argument"
" to process creation functions.  It indicates that the special file "
":data:`os.devnull` will be used for the corresponding subprocess stream."
msgstr ""
"Speciální hodnota, kterou lze použít jako argument *stdin*, *stdout* nebo "
"*stderr* pro funkce pro vytváření procesu. Indikuje, že bude použit "
"speciální soubor :data:`os.devnull` pro odpovídající stream podprocesu."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:163
msgid "Interacting with Subprocesses"
msgstr "Interakce s podprocesy"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:165
msgid ""
"Both :func:`create_subprocess_exec` and :func:`create_subprocess_shell` "
"functions return instances of the *Process* class.  *Process* is a high-"
"level wrapper that allows communicating with subprocesses and watching for "
"their completion."
msgstr ""
"Funkce :func:`create_subprocess_exec` a :func:`create_subprocess_shell` "
"vrací instance třídy *Process*. *Process* je vysokoúrovňový wrapper, který "
"umožňuje komunikaci s podprocesy a sledování jejich dokončení."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:173
msgid ""
"An object that wraps OS processes created by the "
":func:`~asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` and "
":func:`~asyncio.create_subprocess_shell` functions."
msgstr ""
"Objekt, který wrappuje OS procesy vytvořené funkcemi "
":func:`~asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` a "
":func:`~asyncio.create_subprocess_shell`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:177
msgid ""
"This class is designed to have a similar API to the "
":class:`subprocess.Popen` class, but there are some notable differences:"
msgstr ""
"Tato třída je navržena tak, aby měla podobné API jako třída "
":class:`subprocess.Popen`, ale existují některé pozoruhodné rozdíly:"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:181
msgid ""
"unlike Popen, Process instances do not have an equivalent to the "
":meth:`~subprocess.Popen.poll` method;"
msgstr ""
"na rozdíl od Popen, instance Process nemají ekvivalent metody "
":meth:`~subprocess.Popen.poll`;"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:184
msgid ""
"the :meth:`~asyncio.subprocess.Process.communicate` and "
":meth:`~asyncio.subprocess.Process.wait` methods don't have a *timeout* "
"parameter: use the :func:`~asyncio.wait_for` function;"
msgstr ""
"metody :meth:`~asyncio.subprocess.Process.communicate` a "
":meth:`~asyncio.subprocess.Process.wait` nemají parametr *timeout*: použijte"
" funkci :func:`~asyncio.wait_for`;"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:188
msgid ""
"the :meth:`Process.wait() <asyncio.subprocess.Process.wait>` method is "
"asynchronous, whereas :meth:`subprocess.Popen.wait` method is implemented as"
" a blocking busy loop;"
msgstr ""
"metoda :meth:`Process.wait() <asyncio.subprocess.Process.wait>` je "
"asynchronní, zatímco metoda :meth:`subprocess.Popen.wait` je implementována "
"jako blokující busy loop;"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:192
msgid "the *universal_newlines* parameter is not supported."
msgstr "parametr *universal_newlines* není podporován."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:194
msgid "This class is :ref:`not thread safe <asyncio-multithreading>`."
msgstr "Tato třída není :ref:`thread-safe <asyncio-multithreading>`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:196
msgid ""
"See also the :ref:`Subprocess and Threads <asyncio-subprocess-threads>` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Podívejte se také na sekci :ref:`Subprocess and Threads <asyncio-subprocess-"
"threads>`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:202
msgid "Wait for the child process to terminate."
msgstr "Počká, až se podproces ukončí."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:204
msgid "Set and return the :attr:`returncode` attribute."
msgstr "Nastaví a vrátí atribut :attr:`returncode`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:208
msgid ""
"This method can deadlock when using ``stdout=PIPE`` or ``stderr=PIPE`` and "
"the child process generates so much output that it blocks waiting for the OS"
" pipe buffer to accept more data. Use the :meth:`communicate` method when "
"using pipes to avoid this condition."
msgstr ""
"Tato metoda se může zablokovat při použití ``stdout=PIPE`` nebo "
"``stderr=PIPE`` a když podproces generuje tolik výstupu, že se blokuje při "
"čekání, aby OS pipe buffer přijal více dat. Chcete-li se vyhnout tomuto "
"stavu, použijte metodu :meth:`communicate` při práci s pipes."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:217
msgid "Interact with process:"
msgstr "Interakce s procesem:"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:219
msgid "send data to *stdin* (if *input* is not ``None``);"
msgstr "poslat data na *stdin* (pokud *input* není ``None``);"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:220
msgid "closes *stdin*;"
msgstr "zavře *stdin*;"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:221
msgid "read data from *stdout* and *stderr*, until EOF is reached;"
msgstr "čte data z *stdout* a *stderr*, dokud není dosaženo EOF;"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:222
msgid "wait for process to terminate."
msgstr "počká, až se proces ukončí."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:224
msgid ""
"The optional *input* argument is the data (:class:`bytes` object) that will "
"be sent to the child process."
msgstr ""
"Volitelný argument *input* je data (objekt :class:`bytes`), která budou "
"poslána podprocesu."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:227
msgid "Return a tuple ``(stdout_data, stderr_data)``."
msgstr "Vrací tuple ``(stdout_data, stderr_data)``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:229
msgid ""
"If either :exc:`BrokenPipeError` or :exc:`ConnectionResetError` exception is"
" raised when writing *input* into *stdin*, the exception is ignored.  This "
"condition occurs when the process exits before all data are written into "
"*stdin*."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je při zápisu *input* do *stdin* vyvolána výjimka "
":exc:`BrokenPipeError` nebo :exc:`ConnectionResetError`, je výjimka "
"ignorována. Tato podmínka nastane, když se proces ukončí před zápisem všech "
"dat do *stdin*."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:234
msgid ""
"If it is desired to send data to the process' *stdin*, the process needs to "
"be created with ``stdin=PIPE``.  Similarly, to get anything other than "
"``None`` in the result tuple, the process has to be created with "
"``stdout=PIPE`` and/or ``stderr=PIPE`` arguments."
msgstr ""
"Pokud se má poslat data do *stdin* procesu, musí být proces vytvořen s "
"``stdin=PIPE``. Podobně, chcete-li získat cokoli jiného než ``None`` v tuple"
" výsledku, musí být proces vytvořen s argumenty ``stdout=PIPE`` a/nebo "
"``stderr=PIPE``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:240
msgid ""
"Note, that the data read is buffered in memory, so do not use this method if"
" the data size is large or unlimited."
msgstr ""
"Poznámka: data čtená jsou uchovávána v paměti, takže tuto metodu "
"nepoužívejte, pokud je velikost dat velká nebo neomezená."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:245
msgid "*stdin* gets closed when ``input=None`` too."
msgstr "*stdin* se zavře i pokud ``input=None``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:249
msgid "Sends the signal *signal* to the child process."
msgstr "Pošle signál *signal* podprocesu."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:253
msgid ""
"On Windows, :py:const:`~signal.SIGTERM` is an alias for :meth:`terminate`. "
"``CTRL_C_EVENT`` and ``CTRL_BREAK_EVENT`` can be sent to processes started "
"with a *creationflags* parameter which includes "
"``CREATE_NEW_PROCESS_GROUP``."
msgstr ""
"Ve Windows je :py:const:`~signal.SIGTERM` alias pro :meth:`terminate`. "
"``CTRL_C_EVENT`` a ``CTRL_BREAK_EVENT`` lze poslat procesům spuštěným s "
"parametrem *creationflags*, který obsahuje ``CREATE_NEW_PROCESS_GROUP``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:260
msgid "Stop the child process."
msgstr "Zastavuje podproces."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:262
msgid ""
"On POSIX systems this method sends :py:const:`~signal.SIGTERM` to the child "
"process."
msgstr ""
"V systémech POSIX tato metoda pošle :py:const:`~signal.SIGTERM` podprocesu."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:265
msgid ""
"On Windows the Win32 API function :c:func:`!TerminateProcess` is called to "
"stop the child process."
msgstr ""
"Ve Windows je volána funkce Win32 API :c:func:`!TerminateProcess` k "
"zastavení podprocesu."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:270
msgid "Kill the child process."
msgstr "Zabíjí podproces."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:272
msgid ""
"On POSIX systems this method sends :py:data:`~signal.SIGKILL` to the child "
"process."
msgstr ""
"V systémech POSIX tato metoda pošle :py:data:`~signal.SIGKILL` podprocesu."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:275
msgid "On Windows this method is an alias for :meth:`terminate`."
msgstr "Ve Windows je tato metoda alias pro :meth:`terminate`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:279
msgid ""
"Standard input stream (:class:`~asyncio.StreamWriter`) or ``None`` if the "
"process was created with ``stdin=None``."
msgstr ""
"Proud standardního vstupu (:class:`~asyncio.StreamWriter`) nebo ``None`` "
"pokud byl proces vytvořen s ``stdin=None``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:284
msgid ""
"Standard output stream (:class:`~asyncio.StreamReader`) or ``None`` if the "
"process was created with ``stdout=None``."
msgstr ""
"Proud standardního výstupu (:class:`~asyncio.StreamReader`) nebo ``None`` "
"pokud byl proces vytvořen s ``stdout=None``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:289
msgid ""
"Standard error stream (:class:`~asyncio.StreamReader`) or ``None`` if the "
"process was created with ``stderr=None``."
msgstr ""
"Proud standardní chyby (:class:`~asyncio.StreamReader`) nebo ``None`` pokud "
"byl proces vytvořen s ``stderr=None``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:294
msgid ""
"Use the :meth:`communicate` method rather than :attr:`process.stdin.write() "
"<stdin>`, :attr:`await process.stdout.read() <stdout>` or :attr:`await "
"process.stderr.read() <stderr>`. This avoids deadlocks due to streams "
"pausing reading or writing and blocking the child process."
msgstr ""
"Použijte metodu :meth:`communicate` spíše než :attr:`process.stdin.write() "
"<stdin>`, :attr:`await process.stdout.read() <stdout>` nebo :attr:`await "
"process.stderr.read() <stderr>`. To se vyhne zablokování způsobenému pauzou "
"čtení nebo zápisem proudů a blokováním podprocesu."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:303
msgid "Process identification number (PID)."
msgstr "Číslo identifikace procesu (PID)."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:305
msgid ""
"Note that for processes created by the "
":func:`~asyncio.create_subprocess_shell` function, this attribute is the PID"
" of the spawned shell."
msgstr ""
"Poznámka: u procesů vytvořených funkcí "
":func:`~asyncio.create_subprocess_shell` je tento atribut PID spuštěného "
"shell."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:310
msgid "Return code of the process when it exits."
msgstr "Návratový kód procesu při jeho ukončení."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:312
msgid "A ``None`` value indicates that the process has not terminated yet."
msgstr "Hodnota ``None`` indikuje, že se proces dosud nekončil."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:314
msgid ""
"A negative value ``-N`` indicates that the child was terminated by signal "
"``N`` (POSIX only)."
msgstr ""
"Záporná hodnota ``-N`` indikuje, že byl podproces ukončen signálem ``N`` "
"(pouze POSIX)."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:321
msgid "Subprocess and Threads"
msgstr "Podprocesy a vlákna"

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:323
msgid ""
"Standard asyncio event loop supports running subprocesses from different "
"threads by default."
msgstr ""
"Standardní event loop asyncio podporuje spouštění podprocesů z různých "
"vláken ve výchozím nastavení."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:326
msgid ""
"On Windows subprocesses are provided by :class:`ProactorEventLoop` only "
"(default), :class:`SelectorEventLoop` has no subprocess support."
msgstr ""
"Ve Windows jsou podprocesy poskytovány pouze :class:`ProactorEventLoop` "
"(výchozí), :class:`SelectorEventLoop` nemá podporu podprocesů."

#: ../../library/asyncio-subprocess.rst:329
msgid ""
"Note that alternative event loop implementations might have own limitations;"
" please refer to their documentation."
msgstr ""
"Poznámka: alternativní implementace event loopu mohou mít vlastní omezení; "
